        "original_id": "271e49e3-5ab3-5ae1-b086-834fa41ce225",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lollia Paulina, Caligula\n- Roles: Roman empress, Roman emperor\n- Topics: Roman Empire, marriage, reigns\n\nFacts:\n- Caligula, properly Gaius Julius Caesar Augustus Germanicus, was born on 31 August AD 12 and was Roman emperor from AD 37 to AD 41.\n- In AD 38, Lollia Paulina was Roman empress for six months as the third wife and consort of the Roman emperor Caligula.\n- Caligula died on 24 January AD 41.\n- Lollia Paulina, also known as Lollia Paullina, lived from 15 to 49.",
